t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--type is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label wp-block-paragraph\">CATEGORY</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"taxonomy-work_category work-detail__categories work-detail__metadata-value wp-block-post-terms\"><a href=\"/work/\" rel=\"tag\">LIVE</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--role\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">ROLE</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms\"><span>MUSIC PRODUCTION</span> <span>ARRANGEMENT</span> <span>VOCAL PRODUCTION</span> <span>MUSIC DIRECTION</span> <span>GUITAR</span> <span>BASS</span> <span>LIVE ELECTRONICS</span> <span>RECORDING</span> <span>AUDIO EDITING</span> <span>SHOW / MUSIC PROGRAMMING</span></p></div><div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--style\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">STYLE</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms\"><span>POP</span> <span>ROCK</span> <span>J-POP</span> <span>EDM</span> <span>HIP HOP</span> <span>R&amp;B</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-detail__actions\" data-work-detail-actions hidden></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__main is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"work-detail__eyebrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".45\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".3\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".35\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".9\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".4\"/></g></svg><span>LIVE</span><i></i><span>2026</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">E1and Special Showcase 《WONDE1AND》</h1>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--description\" data-work-detail-section=\"ABOUT\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-description-26\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-description-26\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">ABOUT</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-detail__post-content work-detail__description\"><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading screen-reader-text\">Description</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">一場沉浸式、近距離、像踏進房間般的實驗性小專場</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">由E1and本人親自設計舞台，</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">融合樂團編制演出 + DJ形式After Party呈現出她的各種面向</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">概念取材自 Alice in Wonderland ——</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">用歌曲一首一首像揭開蕾絲帷幕般帶領著聽眾走進她最誠實的內心世界。</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">訴說著對這座城市的依戀、矛盾、孤獨與靈感。</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">這場演出想告訴所有曾因為不同而感到疏離的人，</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">邀請你可以在這個空間放心地感受並開心的享受。</p>\n</div></div></section>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--credits\" data-work-detail-section=\"CREDITS\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-credits-26\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-credits-26\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">CREDITS</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><section class=\"work-detail__credits\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-credits-26\"><h2 id=\"work-detail-credits-26\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Credits</h2><dl id=\"work-credits-list-26\" class=\"work-credits work-credits--long is-collapsed\"><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>音樂總監</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>電吉他</dt><dd>任育萱</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>木吉他</dt><dd>韋仲恩</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Bass</dt><dd>韋仲恩</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>KB</dt><dd>陳彥誠</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Programmer</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Band Leader</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>音樂編曲</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>編曲協力</dt><dd>韋仲恩</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>美術</dt><dd>李彬誠</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>器材支援</dt><dd>puzzleman、劉可成</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>硬體統籌</dt><dd>杏桓有限公司</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>音響工程</dt><dd>撼動專業演出工程有限公司</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>燈光工程</dt><dd>達樂工作室</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>舞台監督</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>統籌顧問／後台助理</dt><dd>茅以姍</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>現場協力</dt><dd>高弘宇、劉佩汝</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>演出嘉賓</dt><dd>黃若欣、羅莎莎、李紅</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>技術協力</dt><dd>黃詠仁</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>攝影協力</dt><dd>Aron、蕭裕蒼</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>公關行銷</dt><dd>Boris</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>總監助理</dt><dd>黃詠仁</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>執行統籌</dt><dd>Boris</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>演出場地</dt><dd>GOLDEN CAVE CAFE</dd></div><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>友情贊助</dt><dd>眠豆腐 Sleepy Tofu</dd></div></dl><button type=\"button\" class=\"work-credits__toggle\" data-work-credits-toggle aria-controls=\"work-credits